  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main project for demonstration of the phase-out of HCFCs by using HFOs in PU spray foaming insulation sector in hot climate countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will demonstrate applicability of HFO-1233zd(E) and HFO-1336mzz(Z) use in the PU spray foam insulation sector in the KSA and assess the potential of replication of the results in other hot climate countries.</narrative>
  </description>
